{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake to find yourself locked inside a curious cabin. Explore your surroundings, find clues, and use helpful items to solve the hidden puzzles in each room. Broaden your perspective with each new room to find your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRACE: Definitive Edition is a remaster of the popular 2022 web game TRACE. Praised for its innovative puzzle design and eye-catching graphics, TRACE: Definitive Edition expands on the original with mind-bending new puzzles, gorgeous new visuals, and new areas to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/04779fcd6b7e65d237daeaec701f8357.poster.avif?t=1762883017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/04779fcd6b7e65d237daeaec701f8357.webm?t=1762883017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/04779fcd6b7e65d237daeaec701f8357.mp4?t=1762883017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make clever connections to solve devious puzzles. &quot;Eureka&quot; moments abound!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STUNNING GRAPHICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/aaab176bd9ab773c4a0d2d8c756c8fd7.poster.avif?t=1762883017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/aaab176bd9ab773c4a0d2d8c756c8fd7.webm?t=1762883017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448760/extras/aaab176bd9ab